Summary:  
- Giants have spectral types with luminosity class III or brighter (II, Ib), lower absolute magnitude (brighter), smaller parallax (farther), and redder color index (higher B-V).  
- Non-giants have spectral types with luminosity class V or IV, higher absolute magnitude (fainter), larger parallax (closer), and bluer color index (lower B-V).

